# Task: Compact & Beautify UI — Reduce Vertical Overflow

## 1. Context & Objective
The UI is too tall and requires scrolling to see bottom elements on a standard screen. All pages need tighter margins, smaller section headers, and reduced spacing so the full Generate page fits without scrolling. Visual hierarchy should be preserved but density increased. Only XAML layout files should be touched — no C# or ViewModel changes.

---

## 2. Files to Modify

### `src/IndexTTSStudio/Views/Windows/MainWindow.xaml`
- `OpenPaneLength="220"` → `OpenPaneLength="180"`

---

### `src/IndexTTSStudio/Views/Pages/GeneratePage.xaml`

**Root Grid:**
- `Margin="16,8,16,12"` → `Margin="10,4,10,6"`

