## 3. Implementation Steps
1. Apply changes to `MainWindow.xaml`
2. Apply changes to `GeneratePage.xaml` (most impactful — ensure vector slider rows each get `Height="22"`)
3. Apply changes to `SettingsPage.xaml`
4. Apply changes to `SetupPage.xaml`
5. Apply changes to `HistoryPage.xaml`
6. Apply changes to `VoiceLibraryPage.xaml`
7. **XAML layout only** — do not change any C# code, ViewModels, or bindings

## 4. Completion Instructions
Update this file with a "Changelog" section listing every file modified and the specific attribute changes made.

